{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01256",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 4.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.55,
      "end_seconds": 10.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.42,
      "end_seconds": 16.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Well, I've been having sudden shortness of breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.97,
      "end_seconds": 21.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.06,
      "end_seconds": 26.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "I've had it since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.59,
      "end_seconds": 36.42,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "Alright, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.17,
      "end_seconds": 50.8,
      "duration_seconds": 13.63,
      "text": "Honestly, on and off. I notice it more with breathing in. I've, I've had sharp pain when I breathe in too, for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.8,
      "end_seconds": 59.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.21,
      "text": "Have you had sudden shortness of breath before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.51,
      "end_seconds": 70.79,
      "duration_seconds": 10.28,
      "text": "Yeah, yes, something like this happened a couple of years ago, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.58,
      "end_seconds": 74.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "And what about chest tightness or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.08,
      "end_seconds": 79.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Yeah, no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.3,
      "end_seconds": 84.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Have you had wheeze, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.13,
      "end_seconds": 88.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "So, I haven't noticed any wheeze."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.85,
      "end_seconds": 94.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Hm, okay. How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.09,
      "end_seconds": 96.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.7,
      "end_seconds": 103.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.04,
      "end_seconds": 114.32,
      "duration_seconds": 9.28,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago. I look after my grandchildren most days. I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.96,
      "end_seconds": 118.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.8,
      "end_seconds": 127.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Yes, you know, I had an operation for a hernia, last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.77,
      "end_seconds": 140.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.74,
      "end_seconds": 146.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I have thin bones, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.92,
      "end_seconds": 152.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Sure. Alright, any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.02,
      "end_seconds": 157.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "I've, I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.15,
      "end_seconds": 166.39,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.17,
      "end_seconds": 170.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 171.81,
      "end_seconds": 183.35,
      "duration_seconds": 11.54,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Oxygen saturation is 90 percent, temperature 36.9, pulse is 99 beats a minute, respiratory rate 24, blood pressure 134 over 79."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.16,
      "end_seconds": 186.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Okay, good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.46,
      "end_seconds": 189.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.36,
      "end_seconds": 207.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.46,
      "end_seconds": 211.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Okay, take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.98,
      "end_seconds": 235.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "Your left calf is swollen and tender, and your oxygen is lower than I'd like."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.44,
      "end_seconds": 243.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.18,
      "end_seconds": 265.44,
      "duration_seconds": 10.26,
      "text": "Putting it all together, this is probably a possible blood clot in the lung. I'd also keep a chest infection in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.35,
      "end_seconds": 269.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Right, is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.81,
      "end_seconds": 303.26,
      "duration_seconds": 32.45,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a possible blood clot in the lung, and we'll know more once the a CT scan of the chest is back. I'm sending you for a CT scan of the chest because of breathlessness. You need to go to hospital now for a scan. Let's get you seen by the medical team, I'll arrange the letter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.85,
      "end_seconds": 304.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.27,
      "end_seconds": 322.33,
      "duration_seconds": 16.06,
      "text": "If it hasn't settled in a month, we'd think about a D-dimer blood test, but not now. I'll want another look straight away. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.09,
      "end_seconds": 326.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.98,
      "end_seconds": 329.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}